Build a complete, functional Quick Commerce grocery delivery web app called:

KLICK MART

TAGLINE:
FAST DELIVERY • FRESH GROCERIES

IMPORTANT:
Build this from scratch as a real working application, not just a UI mockup.

TECH STACK:
- React + TypeScript
- Modern responsive frontend
- Node.js backend/API where needed
- Persistent database
- Use environment variables for secrets
- Keep the project easy to deploy from Replit

BRAND DESIGN:
Create an original premium Indian Quick Commerce brand.

Colors:
- Primary Deep Green: #0B6B3A
- Secondary Green: #19A463
- Accent Green: #7ED957
