Typography:
- Modern clean sans-serif
- Montserrat/Inter-style typography
- Strong readable headings
- Clean spacing and rounded cards

Logo:
Create a simple professional KLICK MART logo concept using a shopping cart + subtle leaf/freshness element.
The logo must work in the navbar, splash/landing area and app icon.

Do NOT copy Blinkit, Zepto, Swiggy or any other company's exact UI, logo, colors, text or assets.

