AUTHENTICATION
==================================================

For initial development use a DEV-FRIENDLY MOCK OTP system.

Rules:
- User enters mobile number
- Show OTP screen
- Any 6-digit OTP is accepted in development
- Clearly label this as development authentication
- Do not send real SMS
- Structure authentication so real SMS OTP can be integrated later.

Allow guest browsing.

